                "text": "Before leaving \ud83c\uddee\ud83c\udde9 Indonesian, I met National Armed Forces Commander, Andika Perkasa. With over 200 joint military engagements each year, our bilateral training has never been stronger. Exercise Super Garuda Shield expanded to include over 4,000 combined forces from 14 countries. https://t.co/0Wk9PCUtgJ",
