                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Wheels down in Australia where I will attend AUSMIN 2023 w/ @SecBlinken & Australian counterparts & engage w/ troops participating in the 10th iteration of Exercise Talisman Sabre. With over 30K personnel from 13 nations, we\u2019re committed to maintaining a #FreeandOpenIndoPacific. https://t.co/XUvV3tn8Lr",
