                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was an honor to spend time with troops participating in exercise Talisman Sabre. The Unbreakable Alliance shared by our two nations \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83c\udde6\ud83c\uddfa is fueled by the dedication of our service members. Thank you for your daily service & sacrifice. https://t.co/rynZRoQHv0",
