                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Together, you\u2019re bolstering deterrence by building capability alongside allies and partners. I\u2019m proud that we have 13 countries participating in this year\u2019s exercise who share that common vision for the region. https://t.co/6zJXmY0DSm",
