                "reply_count": 165,
                "retweet_count": 356,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We tragically lost service members during a training\u00a0exercise\u00a0in Australia overnight. These Marines served our country with courage and pride, and my thoughts and prayers are with their families today, with\u00a0the other troops who were injured in the crash, and with the entire USMC family.",
