                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "AUKUS is a once in a generation opportunity that will promote peace and security throughout the Indo-Pacific. Today, we endorsed several new efforts, to include the Maritime Autonomous Experimentation and Exercise Series to lead our partnership forward. https://t.co/MWk3CGig73",
